        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn ATVBD / ATVBI, Double Handleset Spade Tip Mortise Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rustic style of this handleset makes it perfect for traditional homes of all types. It has a black iron finish. This lockset has a identical grip on both the interior and the exterior. Available in single and dummy cylinder functions, it is good for 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors with a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Double Handleset Spade Tip Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handleset Length: 12-3/16”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handleset Width: 3-3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handleset Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors it does not latch and does not lock. Blank cylinder and non-functional thumbpiece on the exterior. Non-functional turnpiece on the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a thumbpiece from the exterior and interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
